Package: csplcsh
Title: Coherent Smoothed Predictive Likelihood for Competing Risks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hao", "Chen", email = "hche2036@uni.sydney.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Clara", "Grazian", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits cause-specific Cox models with locally rescaled,
    nearest-neighbour smoothed baseline hazards. Cumulative hazards are
    obtained by integrating the same adjusted hazards. Provides held-out
    joint log scores, cause-specific score decomposition, shared-fold
    cross-validation, and paired model comparison for competing risks.
